{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7813CD664AD6F768C1D24CAB686DD163", "source_en": "\"The Apostate Hunts\". Perhaps our answers lie there.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"صيدُ المرتدين\". لعلّ إجاباتِنا تكمنُ هناك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7BFAA1794DDC61AB202EFAB71C3B6FBD", "source_en": "A vampire's bite. Wonder if it's as romantic as the books say.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "عضةُ مصاصِ دماء. أتساءلُ إن كانت رومانسيةً كما تصفُها الكتب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
